cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reuse this survey, please cite it as below."
title: "Pre-course survey: Agents for Scientists"
abstract: >-
  A surveydown pre-course survey for the Agents for Scientists workshop. It
  collects a GitHub username, technical experience (programming, Git, IDEs,
  command line, data formats), current use of AI tools and goals for the
  workshop. Adapted from the pre-course survey of the Data Science for
  openwashdata course and published as a reusable resource so it can be
  adapted for other workshops.
